    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hachino University is a corrupt institution only for the richest and most elite members of society. For the past 3 years, you've been tormented and enslaved by a sadistic trio of women who mercilessly abuse you, and despite having been their slave for so long, you start wondering if maybe revenge is a possibility after an opportunity presents itself. Your choices in this game will decide how your relationship with your sadistic trio of abusers ends. With 17 unique endings, your fate is up to you and the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719000/extras/d7f6b6ed3bfc953db48201dbec8f7d0f.webp?t=1750139383\" width=607 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719000/extras/e32d7df0cb061f6e05fd0802d3807ec2.avif?t=1750139383\" width=662 height=258 /></span>Terumi is the sadistic leader of the trio that abuses you. Her family is significantly wealthier than Hanako's and Kaori's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719000/extras/380c1d8aaf6068d87c85d4c972ebff60.avif?t=1750139383\" width=662 height=258 /></span>Hanako is the most violent out of everyone in the trio. Her sadistic urges often overwhelm her and she goes crazy when abusing you, often leaving you hospitalized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719000/extras/420b0e6dd5ccb79248f510b19fa5f07c.avif?t=1750139383\" width=662 height=258 /></span>Kaori is introverted in most aspects of her life, except for when it comes to you and her friends. Her introverted personality disappears quickly when she and her friends starts abusing you for their own pleasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719000/extras/ecf104f5606c91cd6c4664e34af4c001.avif?t=1750139383\" width=662 height=258 /></span>Tori is a mysterious woman who shows up unexpectedly in your life. You don't know her or her motives. She's a complete mystery to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minor characters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719000/extras/dc1daaa5f81b53c935d955e33699d24f.avif?t=1750139383\" width=662 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719000/extras/701b2966ee3d742e51beb79c8fb056e3.avif?t=1750139383\" width=662 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719000/extras/d83cae2e558ef01b1f3ac0d6dd10d494.avif?t=1750139383\" width=662 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719000/extras/a69b4c18e53fca644be3fe9429b9feec.avif?t=1750139383\" width=662 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719000/extras/48d905d2d20848e22cccbb6f959ddd5b.avif?t=1750139383\" width=662 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719000/extras/0fb2a2357a1c0379d48d38a2066b6